 /*==============*/
 /* Installation */
 /*==============*/

    To install the Hypersignal for Windows EL-2 software:

    Insert the Hypersignal for Windows Disk 1 in the floppy drive and
    run the program SETUP.EXE from Microsoft Windows. The installation
    program will prompt you for the location of the program files on 
    the hard disk. It will also create sub-directories as needed. The
    Hypersignal for Windows diskettes contain several compressed files which
    must be decompressed by the installation program.

    Please consult the Hypersignal Users Manual and on-line help for 
    further information on using the Hypersignal for Windows software.



 /*=======================*/
 /* Software Registration */
 /*=======================*/

    We encourage the user to fill out the software registration form which
    is included with your purchase of Hypersignal for Windows. Please complete
    this form and return it to Hyperception. Your cooperation will ensure
    that we have the correct information to send you new updates, new 
    documentation and product information, as well as aid us in supplying
    you with technical support.
    


 /*===================*/
 /* Technical Support */
 /*===================*/

   Technical support questions should be faxed to Hyperception Technical
   Support at 214-343-2457.

   Please provide a detailed explanation of the problem/question
   you have. Also, a copy of your systems config.sys and autoexec.bat
   files should also be included with your fax.



 /*====================*/
 /* Files On This Disk */
 /*====================*/

    Following are the files contained on the Hypersignal for Windows EL-2 
    diskettes:


    Contents of Disk 1
    ------------------

    SETUP    EXE    ; Hypersignal for Windows setup application
    INSTALL  EX$    ; compressed installation application
    INSTALL  INS    ; installation script
    LOGO     BMP    ; Hyperception logo bitmap
    README   DOC    ; this file
    MAC      LIB    ; compressed library of Macro files
    HLP      LIB    ; compressed library of Help files
    EXE      LIB    ; compressed library of Hypersignal for Windows executables
    INI      LIB    ; compressed library of Initialization files
 

    Contents of Disk 2
    ------------------

    WAVEFORM LIB    ; compressed library of Waveform examples
    DLL      LIB    ; compressed library of DLL files
